  2C.1 file-count mismatch -> ENSEMBLE writer drops files
  2C.2 ratio < 0.5         -> ENSEMBLE math produces low/zero
                              values; inspect R/2_calculate_haz_freq.R
                              lines 789-790 / 1131-1132 / 1386-1387
  2C.3 GCM coverage gap    -> some GCMs don't have SSP370 future;
                              normalisation might over-divide
  2C.4 AGO local zero      -> spatial scope; check admin0 mask
                              alignment with ENSEMBLE raster
  All clean                -> drop is in the parquet-write step;
                              inspect R/3_freq_x_exposure.R sec 4.1/4.2
